 game that takes inspiration from the popular game Gorilla Tag. The game features a unique storyline and maps.\n\nThe gameplay in Monky Things has gorilla tags movement, with the player taking on the role of a Monky who woke up in a unknown building and  must solve puzzles and complete tasks to TRY to escape . However, the game puts its own spin on the formula with a variety of unique challenges and obstacles... with some monsters as well...", "short_description": "Monkys is a humorous and spooky game that takes inspiration from the popular game Gorilla Tag. The game features a unique storyline andmaps."}]}, "developer_name": "GameChamber Workshop", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/monkythingsprivacy/home", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Om0eZrnqTKwgOZsmUswq1kA8Rb795LX04UUf41gsbLE/edit?usp=sharing", "publisher_name": "CapuPlay", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/cibstudio/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "SINGLE_USER"], "id": "8567870883334675"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974785_622099093506814_6544690312698292566_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ixHSuKDaDIQQ7kNvwEiouhG&_nc_oc=AdoO84CqIJ8GXOb-syplugsomb9VZ_dw134I-622md3i9Of-